WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.588
xnulinux runs the

00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:02.767
macOS kernel as

00:00:02.579 --> 00:00:03.816
a Linux module

00:00:04.350 --> 00:00:06.012
xnulinux builds XNU

00:00:05.824 --> 00:00:06.861
from Apple's open

00:00:06.673 --> 00:00:07.887
sources and loads

00:00:07.699 --> 00:00:08.347
it as a

00:00:08.159 --> 00:00:09.727
kernel module inside

00:00:09.586 --> 00:00:11.602
an unmodified arm64

00:00:11.414 --> 00:00:11.991
Linux

00:00:12.133 --> 00:00:13.359
booting a macOS

00:00:13.171 --> 00:00:14.809
27 system disk

00:00:14.621 --> 00:00:15.635
to loginwindow

00:00:16.174 --> 00:00:17.034
With a stock

00:00:16.846 --> 00:00:17.848
Ubuntu kernel

00:00:17.990 --> 00:00:19.122
starts the hosted

00:00:18.933 --> 00:00:19.747
XNU

00:00:20.270 --> 00:00:21.331
A small GPL

00:00:21.143 --> 00:00:22.640
interface module lends

00:00:22.534 --> 00:00:24.279
XNU Linux's memory

00:00:24.350 --> 00:00:26.402
timers files network

00:00:26.261 --> 00:00:27.168
and GPU

00:00:27.452 --> 00:00:28.465
the README shows

00:00:28.277 --> 00:00:31.001
macOS 27.2.1 and

00:00:30.824 --> 00:00:32.451
Ubuntu userspaces side

00:00:32.263 --> 00:00:33.041
by side

00:00:33.558 --> 00:00:34.572
Full story on

00:00:34.383 --> 00:00:35.279
the dashboard
